ughter of  Commissioner Gordon from the Gotham  police department they moved to  Metropolis  which makes Barbara or Babs the new girl  in town she was not looking forward to  moving to a new high school we get it  it's hard to fit in a brain  new school luckily Babs meets her crew  she finds friends who accept her for who  she is that is so important in this new  version Babs is goofy and outgoing and  she can be a little awkward especially  when it comes to Batman  she is a total fangirl for him she  freaks out about anything to do with  Batman we can relate some celebrities  just make us go crazy who do you go  total fangirl for let us know in the  comments Babs is more than just a  superfan she is crazy smart in the  original series she got into superhero  high school just because of her brains  she is an inventor she makes all sorts  of gadgets but she's not perfect  she makes lots of mistakes and her  inventions she doesn't sweat it though  even the smartest kids struggle with  stuff sometimes  spats works at the burrito bucket which  isn't a great job sometimes first jobs  are the worst in the original series  Batgirl had a tough dog named ace we  don't know if she has a dog in the new  show but she does get to care for the  class pet it's a hamster  how cute she's a tomboy she rocks a  purple hoodie with that ears and stripes  knee-high socks  she loves sweets her favorite spot to  hang out is sweet justice a pastry shop  YUM that girl takes her role as a  superhero very seriously but she totally  depends on her squad we are so excited  to see this new version of Batgirl in  action she is going to be awesome Wonder  Woman the fearless leader of the Super  Hero Squad is none other than of Wonder  Woman her civilian name is Diana Prince  and she is a princess of the Amazons but  don't let that title fool you she's not  some dainty little princess she is one  tough girl  she has super strength which comes in  really handy when she is fighting crime  she is a sta