sy the new Cara is  tough she doesn't smile much and she's  always ready to fight she thinks  fighting crime is a blast she also has a  really bad habit she sleep flies thus  she goes out flying in her sleep there's  a hilarious super-short where Babs has  to get her back to bed at a sleepover  based on this short it looks like she is  probably still that girl's bestie we are  excited to see how their new  personalities get along the new  Supergirl is more of a tomboy than the  old one she has shorter blonde hair and  huge biceps but she isn't invincible  just like Superman  Supergirl can be defeated by kryptonite  those are colorful rocks from her home  planet they come in several colors and  they all weaken her the green ones are  fatal we are loving this new  interpretation of Supergirl we wonder if  she is still as clumsy as she was before  bumblebee bumblebee was always one of  our favorite characters  we are glad she is back in the new DC  superhero girls  bumblebees real name is Karen Beecher  Duncan we know she is back in the show  but we don't know how much she has  changed we do know that she is almost  always tiny in her superhero form  bumblebee has some really cool powers  she has a really tough exoskeleton like  a bug she can fly and her shrinking  comes in handy she also has enhanced  strength and speed in the original show  Karen was a total social butterfly she  was friendly and outgoing and she loves  to gossip she always knew exactly what  was going on her ability to shrink into  a tiny bug made her a great spy she  could always find out what the  supervillains were plating she would  relay the message back to her squad so  they were never surprised by evil plans  bumblebee is really stylish and those  arm bracelets she wears can emit a sonic  blast pretty cool so far we haven't seen  much from bumblebee but she is there  when they fight mr. freeze she appears  to be shy and unable to stand up for  herself when she is in her human form  we cannot 